Rāma hands bow and arrows to Varuṇa --- Rāma greets sages and reassures distraught Daśaratha --- Rāma orders army to march toward Ayōdhyā --- Daśaratha embraces Rāma and leads army home --- King enters flower-strewn festive Ayōdhyā --- Queens receive Sītā, Ūrmilā and Kuśadhvaja daughters --- Brides worship shrines and rejoice with husbands --- Princes serve father while Rāma shines supreme --- Rāma dwells with Sītā in deepening mutual love